  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "2 Samuel",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 18,
    "summary": "The Israelites are smitten in the woods of Ephraim—Joab slays Absalom—Tidings of his death are taken to David, who mourns for his son.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And David numbered the people that were with him, and set captains of thousands and captains of hundreds over them.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 39
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Samuel 18:1",
        "book": "2 Samuel",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And David sent forth a third part of the people under the hand of Joab, and a third part under the hand of Abishai the son of Zeruiah, Joab’s brother, and a third part under the hand of Ittai the Gittite. And the king said unto the people, I will surely go forth with you myself also.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Samuel 18:2",
        "book": "2 Samuel",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "But the people answered, Thou shalt not go forth: for if we flee away, they will not care for us; neither if half of us die, will they care for us: but now thou art worth ten thousand of us: therefore now it is better that thou succour us out of the city.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 40,
            "end": 48,
            "text": "2 Sam. 21:17."
          },
          {
            "start": 228,
            "end": 238,
            "text": "HEB help us."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 156,
            "end": 164
          },
          {
            "start": 205,
            "end": 210
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "2 Sam. 21:17.",
            "prettyString": "2 Samuel 21:17",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "2samuel",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 21,
                    "end": 21,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 17,
                        "end": 17
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Samuel 18:3",
        "book": "2 Samuel",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "And the king said unto them, What seemeth you best I will do. And the king stood by the gate side, and all the people came out by hundreds and by thousands.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Samuel 18:4",
        "book": "2 Samuel",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "And the king commanded Joab and Abishai and Ittai, saying, Deal gently for my sake with the young man, even with Absalom. And all the people heard when the king gave all the captains charge concerning Absalom.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 27,
            "text": "1 Kgs. 2:5."
          },
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 63,
            "text": "2 Sam. 18:12."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 63
          },
          {
            "start": 103,
            "end": 107
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "1 Kgs. 2:5.",
            "prettyString": "1 Kings 2:5",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "1kings",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 2,
                    "end": 2,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 5,
                        "end": 5
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "raw": "2 Sam. 18:12.",
            "prettyString": "2 Samuel 18:12",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "2samuel",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 18,
                    "end": 18,
                    "verses": [
                      {
